PARITY + STATES + i18n + a11y + telemetry (web source reproduced)
================================================================================
States (all render — no hidden surfaces):
  loading → skeleton chrome (2 temp-card blocks + 3 row blocks + fan block)
  empty   → ContentUnavailableView "No climate data available"  (web <EmptyState/>)
  error   → danger glyph + title + message + TSButton Retry       (web QueryError eq.)
  content → Cabin/Outside temp cards + Driver/Passenger setpoints + HVAC State +
            6-bar Fan Speed meter + Defrost/Climate/Precondition badges (web climateData branch)
  stale   → content + amber freshness chip + reconnecting banner (+ manual Refresh) +
            one-shot auto-refresh
  offline → content (cached) + muted freshness chip + offline banner
Shared components mapped: @/components/ui GlassPanel → TSGlassPanel; @/components/
  data-display MetricCard → native tinted metric card (Cabin/Outside); @/components/
  feedback EmptyState → ContentUnavailableView idiom; retry → TSButton; FadeIn →
  TSFadeIn; skeleton → TSSkeleton.  Charts/maps: none (per source).
Temperature (ADR unit-cutover): snapshot fields are SI °C; converted to the user's
  unit ONLY at the render boundary via the CabinClimatePanelMath reproduction of the
  web convertTempFromSI + formatTemperature (no-space °unit), driven by the prefs the
  source pushes (web useUnits()). No mi/°F/psi stored or modeled.
i18n (P1/S10, table "ClimatePanel"): ALL 13 web t(key,default) keys present
  (common.climate/insideTemp/outsideTemp/on/off, telemetry.driverSetpoint/
   passengerSetpoint/hvacState/fanSpeed/defrost/climate/precondition/noClimateData)
  + 9 native-chrome keys. No English literals in code (every string via the facade).
a11y: header isHeader; each metric card / row / fan meter / badge = single VoiceOver
  element with a composed label; Retry + Refresh carry accessibilityLabel; decorative
  glyphs hidden; Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens; badge row wraps (flow layout) so
  large type never clips; Reduce Motion honored by TSFadeIn/TSSkeleton.
Telemetry: P1/S11 `view.opened` surface="ClimatePanel" emitted once on first start().
Data seam: bound via CabinClimatePanelSource (P1/S8); the view performs NO networking.

